<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16160" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ērŏgātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		erogo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A giving out</i>, <i>paying out</i>,
				<i>a division</i>, <i>distribution</i>: pecuniae, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 15,
				2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; so <i><span class="en">Dig. 25, 1,
				3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">50, 4,
			14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cod. Just. 12, 38, 16 al.</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Front. Aquaed. 77</span></i>
			; so in the plur., <i><span class="en">id. ib.
			3</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Plin. Ep. 10, 35</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Pan. 41,
				1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 13, 50
			al.</span></i>—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A repeal</i>, <i>abrogation</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">legis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Idol. 5</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
